# Aura Workflow

## Main Flow
```
/brainstorm → spec-validation → challenger → /write-plan → /execute-plan → session end
```

## Commands
| Command | When to use |
|---------|-------------|
| `/plan-work` | User describes new work → refine → create N GitHub issues |
| `/brainstorm` | Design before any feature (HARD-GATE before code) |
| `/write-plan` | After spec is approved and challenger gives GO |
| `/execute-plan` | TDD task by task from the plan |
| `/finish-branch` | Branch is ready for PR |
| `/request-review` | Before merge, request structured code review |
| `/doc-check` | After any .md change, verify integrity |
| `/auto-research` | Friction detected → hypothesis-first harness improvement |

## Context Router
| Situation | Load |
|-----------|------|
| Session start | `protocols/session_start.md` |
| New task | `protocols/task_start.md` |
| Git/GitHub | `agents/github.md` |
| Writing code | `agents/language.md` |
| Docker/CI | `agents/infra.md` |
| Pre-merge | `agents/reviewer.md` |
| Challenge a spec | `agents/challenger.md` |
| Session end | `protocols/session_end.md` |

## Session Start Checklist
1. git status + branch + last commits
2. gh auth status
3. Engram context (last session)
4. Issues with label `ready`
5. Show executive summary
6. Ask: "Continue with [next_step] or something new?"
   - Continue → `task_start.md`
   - New work → `/plan-work`

## Session End Checklist
1. Linter + tests pass
2. Verify closed/open issues this session
3. `/doc-check` if .md files changed
4. Save to Engram + update `current-session.json`
5. Propose next step
6. `/auto-research` if friction detected
